  "description": "The protagonist, a short college student, is haunted by frequent nightmares. One day, he discovers that his previous life had been a happy one, thanks to a group of women known as bride candidates. Now bound to an Endless Bride Search, he must face the destiny of finding a new bride after 4995 years. A coming-of-age drama about love, fate, and eternal bonds.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**      \n[Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/8607), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=12457866), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587012958), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000068912)\n\n**Official Translations:**     \n[English](https://honeytoon.com/comic/endless-bride-search)",
